    "scenesThatPass": [
      "BRIDGET: Less old....more childhood.\nBRIDGET/CAMILLA: Hello. Hello.\nBRIDGET: Nice memorial.....as memorials go. Almost makes one look forward to one’s own.",
      "BRIDGET: Oh God, oh God. Who told you?\nMIRANDA: Guilty. Thought it would cheer you up. Hashtag ‘Bridge’s bday’.\nSUSAN: So hot... so many candles.",
      "CATHY: Oooh, it’s harder than you think.\nBRIDGET: It’s all in the throat.\nMIRANDA: And after “NGochi”...\nMIRANDA: ... how do we plan to celebrate tonight?",
      "FLOOR MANAGER: Twenty seconds to air.\nMIRANDA: Anyway, far too many women are wasting their lives having babies in their thirties and forties when they should be getting on with their car…\nFLOOR MANAGER: TEN, nine, EIGHT, seven, SIX, five...\nMIRANDA: Hello, and welcome to Hard News.",
      "MIRANDA: They won’t sack Bridget. She rescued this show, she made it relevant. She made us award winning! And as a result she has no life. Because ev…\nBRIDGET: Thank you Miranda."
    ]
  },
